WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:04.610
Welcome to Epic Games Online Training.

2
00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.650
My name is Sean Lake

3
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:08.130
and I'm one of the instructors here at Epic Games.

4
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:11.070
And I'll be taking you through the Twinmotion Quickstart.

5
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.890
I'll be diving into your very first project

6
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:18.260
in version 2025, which at this point is the most recent.

7
00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.899
This course is intended for those

8
00:00:19.899 --> 00:00:22.579
who are either new to Twinmotion

9
00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:24.859
or just want to start from fresh.

10
00:00:24.859 --> 00:00:26.339
So what we'll be going through

11
00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:29.460
will be what we show today.

12
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.620
What is Twinmotion, who is it for?

13
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.500
As well as we'll be looking at some of the templates

14
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.500
and some of the new ones that have been added.

15
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.340
We'll get to know our UI within Twinmotion

16
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.939
and going through and importing our own assets

17
00:00:40.939 --> 00:00:43.539
or working with Twinmotion assets.

18
00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:45.979
We'll also be working briefly with materials,

19
00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:47.579
setting up some lighting to determine

20
00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:50.140
how we want our mood to be set.

21
00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:53.119
Then we'll be moving into seasons changing

22
00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.859
as well as at the end, we'll be sharing our project

23
00:00:55.859 --> 00:00:58.820
or rather showing us how to show our project.

24
00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.460
And finally, we'll wrap up with the final of everything

25
00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.780
that we have covered.

26
00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.620
So let's not wait any longer, let's get started.
